OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess Anne reunited with
OL,4,Achildhood riding teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess Royal has been reunited
OL,7,Fwith a former Windsor groom who taught
OL,8,Fher to ride more than 70 years ago.
OL,10,FBarbara Rosen, 94, said Princess Anne
OL,11,Fwas three and her brother King Charles
OL,12,Fwas five when she began working at
OL,13,FWindsor Castle in the 1950s.
OL,15,FThe pair met when the princess visited
OL,16,FThe Nicky day centre in Crumpsall as
OL,17,FManchester Jewish Community Care marked
OL,18,Fits 75th anniversary.
OL,20,FRosen said they had a "really nice
OL,21,Fchat", adding: "We both remembered one
OL,22,Fanother."
